  "body": "Asking Price $1,395,000 - the only one at this price. First in, first served!\r\nA rare opportunity to secure an elevated residence with panoramic views, exceptional privacy, and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet high above Mission Bay, this thoughtfully designed freehold residence captures the essence of modern coastal living. Positioned to embrace sweeping views towards Rangitoto Island, the harbour, and Auckland's city skyline, this home offers a rare combination of elevation, convenience, and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nSpread across four well-designed levels, the residence has been carefully crafted to provide both flexibility and effortless living. The ground floor features a private guest suite opening to a secluded garden-an ideal retreat for extended family, guests, teenagers, or a dedicated home office.\r\n\r\nThe main living level is where everyday life unfolds. A beautifully appointed kitchen connects seamlessly with the dining and lounge areas, extending outdoors to a sun-filled balcony where morning coffee, evening entertaining, and relaxed gatherings become part of the daily rhythm.\r\n\r\nAbove, the private rooftop terrace creates a truly special outdoor sanctuary. Enjoy uninterrupted views, host memorable occasions, or simply unwind while taking in Mission Bay's ever-changing skyline and coastal outlook.\r\nPerfectly positioned beside Eastridge Shopping Centre, with reserves, cafes, beaches, and local amenities nearby, this home offers the ultimate convenience while enjoying the prestige of one of Auckland's most sought-after seaside neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nZoned for Kohimarama School and Selwyn College, this is a residence that combines lifestyle appeal with enduring value.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Freehold title with no body corporate\r\n* Elevated position with panoramic Rangitoto and city views\r\n* Private rooftop terrace designed for entertaining and relaxation (approx. 42m2)\r\n* Three bedrooms, three bathrooms, plus guest powder room (floor size 158m2)\r\n* Flexible ground-floor guest suite with private garden\r\n* Open-plan living with excellent indoor-outdoor connection\r\n* Internal access single garage and separate laundry facilities\r\n* Close to Eastridge Shopping Centre, reserves, and Mission Bay amenities\r\n* Zoned for Kohimarama School and Selwyn College\r\n* 12-month maintenance period from settlement\r\n* CV: $1,850,000\r\n* Individual or bulk purchase options available.\r\n\r\nOne of only four residences available, this is a rare opportunity to secure a low-maintenance home in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nContact Bowen or Kristine today to arrange your private viewing.",
